Name: Wazuh DHCP Asset Discovery

Version: 2.1.0-RC3

Status: Release Candidate

Compatible:
- Wazuh 4.14.5
- Ubuntu 22.04 LTS
- Python >= 3.10

Project:
DHCP Asset Discovery for Wazuh Manager

Features:
- DHCP Lease Discovery
- Asset Inventory
- Whitelist Support
- Wazuh Level 12 Alert Rule
- Vendor Lookup
- Weekly OUI Database Update
- Daily Unknown Asset Alert Suppression
- Vendor Enriched Unknown Asset Alerts
- Managed Agent Detection
- DHCP Unknown Detection
- Wazuh Event Integration
- Systemd Service
- Automatic Installer

